{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready for a breathtaking journey! This game is a virtual tour that will transport you to the heart of Canada, from the harsh Arctic deserts to the bustling streets of Toronto. This is not just a puzzle\u2014it's your personal journey the length of an entire country!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4097090/extras/999bee9131cab311e30cf2836f53f950.poster.avif?t=1762967644\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4097090/extras/999bee9131cab311e30cf2836f53f950.webm?t=1762967644\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4097090/extras/999bee9131cab311e30cf2836f53f950.mp4?t=1762967644\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WHY YOU'LL LOVE THIS JOURNEY:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Become a True Explorer:</strong> Lace up your boots and set off to conquer the snowy peaks of the Rocky Mountains, experience the silence of the endless tundra, lose yourself in the reflection of emerald lakes, and spend a day in a vibrant metropolis. Each location is a new postcard, full of color and life.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenge Your Mind with Pleasure:</strong> Your companions will be dozens of diverse challenges. You'll find engaging searches for hidden objects in the most unexpected places, clever mini-games that will keep you from getting bored, and more than 20 challenging but interesting puzzles that will truly make your brain glow!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collect Memories:</strong> Throughout your journey, you will find unique collectibles\u2014find them all to keep as a memento of your great Canadian adventure.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Relax in a Cozy Atmosphere:</strong> Stunning graphics, detailed to the smallest elements, and calm, melodic music create the perfect atmosphere for relaxation after a hard day. Just lean back in your chair and enjoy the view.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is the perfect escape for those who dream of travel, love puzzles, or just want to forget about the hustle and bustle for an hour.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4097090/extras/93eac44e185db7eeca7ecc38d3585343.poster.avif?t=1762967644\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4097090/extras/93eac44e185db7eeca7ecc38d3585343.webm?t=1762967644\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4097090/extras/93eac44e185db7eeca7ecc38d3585343.mp4?t=1762967644\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SPECIAL COLLECTOR'S EDITION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For the most avid travelers, there is a <strong>Collector's Edition</strong>! Want to extend the pleasure and get the most out of your trip? This is your choice! You will find exclusive bonus content that will make your adventure even richer and more interesting. Discover everything that was left behind the scenes of the standard route.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"First Step","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4097090/88dad2cc4a2251f36ba602319206424dad3ea198.jpg"},{"name":"Diamond Eye","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4097090/d2f8768689a4d1d687d57ee410bb7ffca46d8751.jpg"},{"name":" Collector","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4097090/c2c05dc76ea964bb674d